# Makefile
# Owner: P1
# Purpose: Shortcuts for the team.
# Depends on: docker-compose.yml, backend/, frontend/
# Used by: every team member
#
# PROMPT:
# Write only this file. Recipes must be indented with tabs.
#
# Requirements:
# - install: pip install -r backend/requirements.txt, then npm install inside frontend/.
# - db: docker compose up -d db. db-down: docker compose down.
# - api: cd backend, then uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000.
# - web: cd frontend, then npm run dev.
# - seed: cd backend, then python -m app.seed.seed. test: cd backend, then pytest -q.
# - Declare every target in .PHONY.
#
# Do not:
# - Add targets that are not listed.
# - Assume a virtual environment path; use plain python and pip.
#
# Done when: make db, make seed, make api and make test all run without editing the
# Makefile.
#
# Context to paste first: docs/P1_CONTEXT.md, docs/statuses-and-events.md,
# docs/api-contract.md, plus the headers of the files listed under Depends on.
